IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cat-domain`
IMPORT `cat-regs-sch3-fees`
IMPORT `tests-fixtures`

-- TESTS — Cat Regulations 2012 Schedule 3: one scenario per row of the
-- Table, each with and without the pensioner rate of cl 1(3).
-- Amounts are copied from inputs/cat-regulations-2012.txt lines 707-728.

§ `Tests — Schedule 3 fees`

GIVEN pensioner IS A BOOLEAN
      g         IS A `Grant or renewal`
      term      IS A `Registration term`
      m         IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Registration application`
`an application, pensioner:` pensioner `,` g `for` term `made` m MEANS
    `Registration application` WITH
        `applicant`        IS `an adult named` "Applicant" `, a pensioner:` pensioner
        `grant or renewal` IS g
        `term applied for` IS term
        `date made`        IS m
        `date determined`  IS m

§§ `Item 1 — one year`

-- (a) "if application is for grant of registration and is made after 31 May
-- for registration until the next 31 October" — $10.00.
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 6 1))   EQUALS 10.00
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 10 31))  EQUALS 10.00
-- 31 May itself is not "after 31 May": (b), $20.00.
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 5 31))   EQUALS 20.00
-- A grant applied for in November buys almost a full year (fork F-10): (b).
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2025 11 15))  EQUALS 20.00
-- (a) is for a GRANT only; a renewal made in July is (b).
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a renewal` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 7 1))  EQUALS 20.00
-- cl 1(3): a pensioner pays 50%.
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` TRUE  `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 6 1))    EQUALS 5.00
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` TRUE  `,` `a renewal` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2026 7 1))  EQUALS 10.00

§§ `Item 2 — 3 years`

#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `3 years` `made` (YMD 2026 6 1))     EQUALS 42.50
-- No item 1(a)-style discount for 3 years: $42.50 whenever made.
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a renewal` `for` `3 years` `made` (YMD 2025 10 20)) EQUALS 42.50
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` TRUE  `,` `a grant` `for` `3 years` `made` (YMD 2026 6 1))     EQUALS 21.25

§§ `Item 3 — life`

#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `the life of the cat` `made` (YMD 2026 1 10)) EQUALS 100.00
#ASSERT `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` TRUE  `,` `a grant` `for` `the life of the cat` `made` (YMD 2026 1 10)) EQUALS 50.00

§§ `Item 4 — approval to breed`

GIVEN who IS A Person
      n   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Breeding application`
`a breeding application by` who `for` n `breeding cats` MEANS
    `Breeding application` WITH
        `applicant`               IS who
        `grant or renewal`        IS `a grant`
        `date made`               IS YMD 2026 1 10
        `date determined`         IS YMD 2026 1 20
        `number of breeding cats` IS n
        `findings`                IS `Breeding application findings` WITH
                                        `no, or insufficient, facilities to breed cats in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
                                        `no, or unsuitable, premises where cats can be bred in a safe and ethical way` IS FALSE
                                        `not a fit and proper person to breed cats` IS FALSE

-- "$100.00 per breeding cat (male or female)".
#ASSERT `the breeding approval fee payable for` (`a breeding application by` (`an adult named` "B" `, a pensioner:` FALSE) `for` 1 `breeding cats`) EQUALS 100.00
#ASSERT `the breeding approval fee payable for` (`a breeding application by` (`an adult named` "B" `, a pensioner:` FALSE) `for` 3 `breeding cats`) EQUALS 300.00
-- cl 1(3) reaches only registration applications: a pensioner breeder pays in full.
#ASSERT `the breeding approval fee payable for` (`a breeding application by` (`an adult named` "B" `, a pensioner:` TRUE)  `for` 2 `breeding cats`) EQUALS 200.00

§§ `Before 25 September 2025`

#ASSERT REFUSED `the registration fee payable for` (`an application, pensioner:` FALSE `,` `a grant` `for` `one year` `made` (YMD 2025 6 1))
